      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUMBLE TIGRESS (2) turned in a modest effort most recently when sixth at Lithgow over 531m behind Tommy Blue (31.16) in a Grade 5. Ready to return to form. MUSCLE MEMORY (1) struggled in tougher grade last start at this track, but prior to that won by 0.8 lengths at this track (18.00) beating Pony Tail in a Grade 3/4 on October 29. Has ability and can measure up. SHOT OF MAGIC (7) finished fourth last time at this track but could not have been more impressive before that in his excellent 22.30 win at Maitland over 400m. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. LEVI DESIGN (4) generally performs well over this distance.",
